  "description": "A geocoding dataset for Saudi Arabia containing over 35,000 address-level records organized into H3 spatial index tiles, covering street addresses with full administrative hierarchy (district, governorate, region) in both Arabic and English. Includes companion polygon boundary layers for Saudi regions, governorates, and districts, plus a postcode index and a world countries reference layer.",
